      "name": "comment",
      "x": 48.9,
      "y": 13,
      "text": "You can enter a \"tuplets, for example triplets or quintuplets.\n\nTo Do:\n* Click on the score module header to open the score editor window.\n* Press 'E' for eighth notes.\n* Press ALT+3 for eighth note triplets.\n* Enter some notes in an empty measure. See the orange tuplet bar over them.\n* When you fill the triplet with three notes the tuplet bar will turn black.\n* In a new measure, Press 'E' then ALT+N. A dialog will appear.\n* Try \"Fit 7 into 3\". Enter 7 notes in the septuplet. See the \"7:3\" ratio.\n* Press 'E' again to get a Rest. Click on some septuplet notes to have rests in the tuplet.",
